* Analog contact via passive-only lexical wrapper
Vinput d 0 PULSE(0 3.3 5n 1n 1n 20n 50n)
Aproducer [d] [p] M
Asense [p] [q] M
Xload p LOAD
Vother x 0 3.3
Xother x LOAD
Rout q 0 100k
.model M d_logic_block family="HC" vsupply=3.3 input_load=2p sink_current=-1m source_current=2m out_res=40 out_delay=1n def="out[0]=in[0];"
.subckt LOAD p
Rload p 0 100
.ends LOAD
.tran 5p 45n 0 5p
.PRINT TRAN V(q) I(Vinput) I(Vother)
.end
